---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT a FROM (SELECT a, b, EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM u WHERE u.a = t.a) AS e FROM t) WHERE (e OR b = 'x') AND a > 1"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Filter (exists#7 or (b#1 == 'x'))
   +- Join ExistenceJoin(exists#7), (a#3 == a#0)
      :- Filter (a#0 > 1)
      :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1]
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3]
